zA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1858430?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian","html_url":"https://github.com/suddjian","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-18T20:57:24Z","updated_at":"2025-02-18T20:57:24Z","body":"done 🙏  What do we think about those open questions? Is this looking satisfactory as is?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2666914589/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2667037652","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102834#issuecomment-2667037652","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102834","id":2667037652,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6e98PU","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-18T22:11:17Z","updated_at":"2025-02-18T22:11:17Z","body":"Hovering nodes in Scene dock will unfold them. While it makes sense, hovering the nodes is also used to show them in the inspector (for dragging into NodePath fields), so there is functionality conflict.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2667037652/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2667057553","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102834#issuecomment-2667057553","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102834","id":2667057553,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6e-BGR","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-18T22:23:23Z","updated_at":"2025-02-18T22:23:23Z","body":"Implementing wait time differently than theme property would be considerably involved, so it's *probably* fine in the end.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2667057553/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2667505730","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102834#issuecomment-2667505730","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102834","id":2667505730,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6e_uhC","user":{"login":"suddjian","id":1858430,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTg0MzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1858430?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian","html_url":"https://github.com/suddjian","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-19T04:53:34Z","updated_at":"2025-02-19T05:06:24Z","body":"> hovering the nodes is also used to show them in the inspector (for dragging into NodePath fields), so there is functionality conflict.\r\n\r\n🤔 Here are the options as I see them:\r\n\r\n1. No changes. Dragging over a scene tree item will unfold that branch and also inspect that node. This could be considered reasonable much of the time, because there are many cases where both of these contain valid drop targets. And maybe you want to drag something into the inspector of a child node of a folded branch.\r\n2. Only unfold tree items if `can_drop_data` returns true (am I understanding that function correctly?). This may be reasonable more of the time, but still could be considered a functionality conflict. I don't believe we have a good equivalent check for the inspector, seeing #70148.\r\n3. Add some kind of UI to give the user control over whether they want the tree item to unfold, or the inspector to open. I'm not sure what this would look like. Multiple hover targets inside a tree item to offer user choice? Sounds weird to me but maybe. I believe this is the only option that doesn't result in surprise inspector changes (4 would count, except people may drag expecting to unfold the tree, and get an inspector change instead).\r\n4. Disable unfold-on-hover for the scene tree. And maybe disable it by default? I'm not sure what other drag-and-drop trees exist in the editor (or in user projects of course). I have so far presumed that drag-unfolding will be useful more often than not.\r\n\r\nI don't feel strongly towards any of these options right now and would appreciate any sage wisdom from more experienced folks on this.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2667505730/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":nu