ub.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102834#issuecomment-2667524898","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102834","id":2667524898,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6e_zMi","user":{"login":"suddjian","id":1858430,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTg0MzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1858430?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian","html_url":"https://github.com/suddjian","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suddjian/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-19T05:11:07Z","updated_at":"2025-02-19T05:19:30Z","body":"Drag and drop seems to be disabled for touch anyway, if I read this correctly?\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/cd0fc8634b932bb1f70cca60268e430ef2ccf897/scene/gui/tree.cpp#L5624-L5640\r\n\r\nEdit: I believe right click also wouldn't work with a macbook touchpad though, unfortunately for me, so I am biased against that option as the person who originally proposed the feature 🥲  (I also would never think to right click while dragging for additional interactions. Is that a thing I should be trying in my general software usage?)\r\n\r\nMaybe a keypress could work the same way, with a contextual UI prompt to raise awareness of it.\r\n\r\nedit edit: is a touch pad what touch dragging is referring to in the above code? I was imagining like a touchscreen interface. But I can de